  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 59 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 + 2 = 81\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\n59 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 + 2 = 81 ⇒ 59 - 44 + 11 × 13 ÷ 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 - 44 + 11 × __**13 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 59 - 44 + __**11 × 6.5**__ = 81\n\n⇒ __**59 + 71.5**__ - 44 = 81\n\n⇒ __130.5** - 44**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 86.5 ≠ -81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and − \n\n59 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 + 2 = 81 ⇒ 59 + 44 ÷ 11 × 13 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 + __**44 ÷ 11**__ × 13 - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 + __**4 × 13**__ - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**59 + 52**__ - 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __111** - 2**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 109 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) - and ×\n\n59 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 + 2 = 81 ⇒ 59 × 44 ÷ 11 - 13 + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 × __**44 ÷ 11**__ - 13 + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**59 ×**____** 4**__ - 13 + 2 = 81\n\n⇒ __**236 + 2**__ - 13 = 81\n\n⇒ __238____** - 13**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 225 ≠ 81 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\n59 - 44 ÷ 11 × 13 + 2 = 81 ⇒ 59 - 44 ÷ 11 + 13 × 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 - __**44 ÷ 11**__ + 13 × 2 = 81\n\n⇒ 59 - 4 + __**13 × 2**__ = 81\n\n⇒ __**59 + 26**__ - 4 = 81\n\n⇒ __85____** **____**- 4**__ = 81\n\n⇒ 81 = 81 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
